                "text": "Proud to speak in favor of my bill, the VSO Equal Tax Treatment Act, as it passed on the House floor. This legislation will update our tax code to ensure that all charitable donations to Congressionally chartered Veterans Service Organizations are tax-deductible. \n\nWe should encourage charitable donations so these veterans' organizations can continue their critical work to support those that have served us well. Watch my remarks \ud83d\udc47",
